# Shared starter .cursorignore for ~/code projects.
# Copy to a repo as `.cursorignore` and trim/add as needed.
# Goal: keep agent indexing/search off bulky, generated, or secret-adjacent trees.

# VCS / env
.git/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Python
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/

# Node / frontend
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/coverage/

# Containers / local runtime junk
**/.podman/
**/containerdata/

# Agent / browser / research dumps (often huge, rarely source of truth)
**/.playwright-mcp/
**/docs/research/
**/docs/HANDOFF-*.md
**/tmp_*/
**/tmp/

# Locks / binaries / media
**/uv.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/*.min.js
**/*.map
**/*.wasm
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.pdf

# OS
.DS_Store
